    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "he motto “Honour and Skill” of the South African Sea Cadets is proudly displayed under their badge. These words embody the core values of the Corps which are: Integrity, excellence and service, which are instilled in the"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 7,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 51.026, 500.613, 233.627, 565.019 ],
    "font" : "Palatino-Roman",
    "font size" : 9.2,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Sea Cadets via their training and interaction with competent instructors. These three words embody the cardinal points of a Sea Cadet’s compass of life and include: Honesty, morality, loyalty, responsibility, discipline, accountability, self-respect and obedience."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 8,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 51.026, 447.621, 226.46, 501.429 ],
    "font" : "Palatino-Roman",
    "font size" : 9.2,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "The Sea Cadets also teach the necessary knowledge and provides practical skills underwritten by accredited courses necessary for those who wish to follow a career at sea within the maritime industry."
